flowchart TD
  A[Request GET or HEAD] --> B[PlatformContextMiddleware sets Current.platform from the host]
  B --> C[RedirectMiddleware]
  C --> D{Path matches an active redirect for this platform?}
  D -- yes --> E[301 302 307 308 with Location, or 410 Gone]
  D -- no --> F[Rails router]
  F --> G{Route found?}
  G -- yes --> H[Controller loads the record by slug]
  G -- no --> I[Pages catch-all]
  I --> H
  H --> J{Slug is a former FriendlyId slug?}
  J -- yes --> K[301 to the current slug]
  J -- no --> L[Render the page or 404]
